# Boot into Studex OS — Hermes + Herdr + agents (daily)

Runbook: `docs/STUDEX_OPERATING_SYSTEM.md`

## Mesh

- [ ] Tailscale on (phone + hub + workers)
- [ ] `npm run fleet:connect -- --soft-fail` on hub/dev Mac

## Herdr + Obsidian

- [ ] `herdr` running; plugin **ping** PASS
- [ ] Today’s note open: `herdr/studex-ops.md` or `herdr/<this-machine>.md`
- [ ] Panes: `hermes` and/or `claude` cwd = Portable-agents

## Hermes + Paperclip

- [ ] Mac Mini: Paperclip `http://macmini:3100` health
- [ ] Hermes Lead on hub; gateways on MSI/VM if assigned
- [ ] Phone: Hermes app; task_bridge if invited

## Agents together (one task)

- [ ] Paperclip task OR factory ZTE-* picked
- [ ] Checklist line ▶ sent to pane
- [ ] OpenBot handoff if two agents needed
- [ ] Checkbox auto when idle

## Close

- [ ] `npm run factory:status`
- [ ] `agent-work-archive.sh` → Stud-Bot-Depo
- [ ] Optional: `planning-daily-report --slot pm`